  "$comment": "An Axis victory in Europe, and the war that did not stop. Built from documented war aims -- the occupation administrations, Generalplan Ost's settlement zone, the Atlantic defences -- and from nothing else. The premise is an alternate history older than any game that uses it (The Man in the High Castle, 1962; Fatherland; SS-GB); the invented states, characters and lore of the mods set in the same premise belong to their authors and are not used, referenced or implied. See docs/scenario-licensing.md.\\n\\nTHE OCCUPATION IS NOT A SEAT. NSR is withheld from play by Game::countryWithheldFromPlay, which lives in the binary rather than here -- a flag in this file would be a flag anyone could clear. It carries a plain administrative banner in BOTH flag fields, because the actual/censored setting belongs to the player and cannot enforce anything: no historical insignia of that regime ships in this map at all.\\n\\nThe seats are the people still fighting it.",
